WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:04.813
Let's follow the signal, starting at the cell tower in the distance.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:14.184
The outdoor antenna is aimed toward the tower to pick up the available cellular signal.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.281
This coaxial cable carries the signal indoors.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.557
Here is the black booster.

00:00:21.557 --> 00:00:26.702
It amplifies the incoming signal and has its own built-in indoor antenna.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.371
For this setup, a second cable leads to a separate indoor antenna.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.934
That's the white panel on the wall.

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:43.789
It lets you position the indoor antenna away from the main unit.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:54.065
From the tower to your living space, each part has a clear role.

00:00:54.065 --> 00:00:58.486
Choose Internal, External, or Dual mode to suit your setup.
